<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n111775" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φλῑά</span></b>  (later <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φλειά,</span> prob. in <i><span class="en">
			<u>Jahresh.</u>
			28.54
		</span></i> (Oropus, <span class="entity">i B. C.</span>)), ἡ,
		mostly in pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φλιαί,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>doorposts, jambs,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Od.
				17.221
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Bion
				1.87
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>De.</u>
				6.9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				12.11.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>AJ</u>
				5.8.10
			</span></i>: in sg., <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12.386.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				23.18
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρὰ φλιῇ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Call.
					<u>Iamb.</u>
					1.220
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ψάφισμα . . ἀναγράψαι ἐς τὰν φλιάν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					12(3).170.24
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Astypalaea</span>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				12(7).237.50
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Amorgos</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>lintel,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				3.278
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τᾶς φ. καθ᾽ ὑπέρτερον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Theoc.
					2.60
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>standing posts in which a windlass works,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Art.</u>
				47
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>support,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φ. πιοειδής</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ruf.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				49.27.7
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Art.</u>
				73
			</span></i>.</div>
